{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/mre1o609ra1dpnzd3x2lv0wvww1nn1s.mp3","text":"面前放着这么多纸，要克制住点火的冲动也挺难的——呃，别那么盯着我啊，我开玩笑的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/eeg65lqugmf1uaznrl7ohlmtxum45f5.mp3","text":"博士，我司员工都是土生土长的雷姆必拓人，对当地环境了如指掌。如果有干员去雷姆必拓需要护卫，请务必交给我司，价格好商量！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/bxvygoj7nv135da4k1z3z0z7tazxb4o.mp3","text":"明知道对生意不利，为什么还雇佣感染者？这个......反正大家都知道矿石病是如何传染的，只要做好防护和监测就行，你看罗德岛不也是这样嘛，哈哈，哈哈。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/7t1y50vasl0r4fsypkptft0xoqvf81q.mp3","text":"“用合适的弹药改变战局”，炮手都知道这句话，于是他们往包里塞了榴霰弹、震撼弹、曳光弹，事到临头却不知道该用什么。而我只带燃烧弹就够了。只要用得好，它可以顶替任何一种弹药。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/fujht1n6i9r23kad23l5p5w3cno8lxa.mp3","text":"读大学的时候，我最讨厌的就是别人总提我爸——家庭矛盾？那倒不是。我爸人不坏，我也很感谢他，但总有人问都不问就把我当成矿老板家只会花钱的大小姐！他是他，我是我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/26et01bawd3qw1nj5sb7xhcr0v3eyq0.mp3","text":"我爸禁止我碰火，我妈让我少和矿工的孩子玩，前东家让我少管闲事，还有好多人告诉我别对感染者太好，这些话我一句也不听。对错要靠自己判断，一时判断不出也要先唱唱反调，我就是这样的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/bc00wh7r47wqpz37wfs5i23s3fqnvdk.mp3","text":"那个小消防员一看到我就浑身紧绷，还用水炮对着我，可爱是挺可爱的，但总这样也不好。博士，下次我们仨喝一杯吧，麻烦你帮我消除一下她对我的误会，我请你们喝我自己调的火焰鸡尾酒。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/7vht4y85m5sf74ny6rrbi0m3q2p4l6q.mp3","text":"我其实发现了，自己不擅长经商，可我切切实实地体会过什么叫做“寄人篱下”“无能为力”。连年亏损当然是另一种无奈，但就算是因为破产坐牢，也比被人吩咐烧死自己的战友要强得多。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/d0m9c0jk82ht0r1lji8d8jjebd88jh0.mp3","text":"我小时候很迷行军打仗，最想当的是大将军。但雷姆必拓没有这样的土壤，所以我只能进私人安保公司。现在？现在我只想让手下吃饱穿暖。至于将军梦，第一次看到身边有人中箭的时候就淡了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/a1iyh6yu40dh05c49gsgffdzgeeaqas.mp3","text":"呼啊......好无聊啊，摆个榴弹塔吧——欸，你其实没睡？！不不不，这是空包弹，空包弹！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/4wjnlsc108jgz8vlfxykzj2zyv3ijq6.mp3","text":"感谢您选择与我司合作！我是火哨安保公司的负责人，我叫——欸？干员代号？嗯......直接叫我火哨好了！没错，这也是提升客户认知度的重要环节！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/oysjd8lpgih1sfu7buzapx1zsqhs4bo.mp3","text":"这战术不错，要是在那个位置点把火就更完美了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/2ihvxnt7gjoladb7crz2ajw4vx4wjjd.mp3","text":"晋升？多谢多谢，要是能多给我派几单安保任务我也会很开心的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/fcxodog5fbjravdafl218u38hkgvcal.mp3","text":"和罗德岛达成合作之后，火哨公司终于扭亏为盈，我也不用再掏私房钱发工资了！博士，真的太感谢你了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/s92bja27l1e7rsjj80wx7qkvlhv5h1v.mp3","text":"火哨，竭诚为你服务！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/jriit71fadh9wdg5jzt741bejhbr8xe.mp3","text":"队长？没问题，这个位置我再熟悉不过了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/iiim9jn9tr1mk80mjt5v9jy7vi6ptjf.mp3","text":"出发，任务结束之后我请客！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/j9smtbs2l4jk03x3f2lklkejikotpnz.mp3","text":"大家先做好隐蔽，等火点起来再动手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/4e7u279bcsbs0xcmsmb2xfxfc9h32kq.mp3","text":"怎么，需要点火焰助助兴？","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/s7h9z12vc4kndf6n2g1ssr4dbmr75li.mp3","text":"请尽管下令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/7s5l28nmh4q2ii52wgpyl222rv06kcv.mp3","text":"准备就绪，随时可以点火。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/as1sa7w6ffjysxy335yjeineatemgtx.mp3","text":"炮手就位！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/14rl75o73zk4kj6qrfapromvp23r6rq.mp3","text":"烧吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/2c8poviy0oual19oc528fdfgmuwvtnl.mp3","text":"这一发是送给你的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/28dbkzo74h0ta6j0bwvsodyd5um569w.mp3","text":"惊慌失措会被烧得更惨哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/otq7mdvuu452zau4bfjp1fwax4su97z.mp3","text":"装填，发射！","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/0aeu8kkvvn11i8wg9x016r4nkuehv3n.mp3","text":"这也可以？！唉......要是我司也有一个像你一样的战术天才就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/0pk30edfbdnbzwa25100u2x4d850hkf.mp3","text":"收工之前，先陪我去把火灭了吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/3jilqkoqs1ihtbwnxh2unj1g6uu3ynr.mp3","text":"要是放着不管，阴燃的柴草总有一天会变成火灾的源头，请务必注意。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/aqhirs1ps56oq89sn9rhqqn6sejaylj.mp3","text":"我来断后。别担心，这样的仗我打过不知多少次了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/meo0lldedvhsv3xlrfrj9zc06hocr5a.mp3","text":"和我租的那间小办公室相比，罗德岛的设施真齐全啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/2y2wlrr9p1njudsvksfvmyk2gjodqtw.mp3","text":"想看烟花吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/gyby2chtfb7yt7vpvrx6kju1qt45fwl.mp3","text":"给，弹壳做的工艺品。怎么样，我手艺不错吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/l3mdxk4f1n12dz6wjg2kfjhmp454w31.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/m4086pgnl6jmughch7eq3inn7rf7qv9.mp3","text":"稍等，博士，我在整理年度财务报表......好了！听说罗德岛上不少雷姆必拓干员的手艺都不错，一起去尝尝吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/8z58cpllj6p676mjjn483ff85ix4qxm.mp3","text":"你好啊，博士，想不想生把火暖和一下？","alt":"voice_cn/char_493_firwhl/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/4yje9324dsbtih1gyg47v7h03kw3nhe.mp3","text":"面前放着这么多纸，要克制住点火的冲动也挺难的——呃，别那么盯着我啊，我开玩笑的。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/51tgph6edgj6f0dwuonbe76yl1u4c8y.mp3","text":"博士，我司员工都是土生土长的雷姆必拓人，对当地环境了如指掌。如果有干员去雷姆必拓需要护卫，请务必交给我司，价格好商量！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/p9flzikjbyp2d6uhf3q78ptle3mx4db.mp3","text":"明知道对生意不利，为什么还雇佣感染者？这个......反正大家都知道矿石病是如何传染的，只要做好防护和监测就行，你看罗德岛不也是这样嘛，哈哈，哈哈。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/mbv8l038x9tnnisohzio53f9vdro22s.mp3","text":"“用合适的弹药改变战局”，炮手都知道这句话，于是他们往包里塞了榴霰弹、震撼弹、曳光弹，事到临头却不知道该用什么。而我只带燃烧弹就够了。只要用得好，它可以顶替任何一种弹药。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/rilrib7fifav2z12f3gbcxxw1tx66dj.mp3","text":"读大学的时候，我最讨厌的就是别人总提我爸——家庭矛盾？那倒不是。我爸人不坏，我也很感谢他，但总有人问都不问就把我当成矿老板家只会花钱的大小姐！他是他，我是我！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/56/971xooljsw82fwq8o658g6uqjb9r9pq.mp3","text":"我爸禁止我碰火，我妈让我少和矿工的孩子玩，前东家让我少管闲事，还有好多人告诉我别对感染者太好，这些话我一句也不听。对错要靠自己判断，一时判断不出也要先唱唱反调，我就是这样的人。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/6s5eo0b6phnq1rlb6dw66mou4jqw2wp.mp3","text":"那个小消防员一看到我就浑身紧绷，还用水炮对着我，可爱是挺可爱的，但总这样也不好。博士，下次我们仨喝一杯吧，麻烦你帮我消除一下她对我的误会，我请你们喝我自己调的火焰鸡尾酒。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/i1u4hjtt0fezagm91r61381qmh45abw.mp3","text":"我其实发现了，自己不擅长经商，可我切切实实地体会过什么叫做“寄人篱下”“无能为力”。连年亏损当然是另一种无奈，但就算是因为破产坐牢，也比被人吩咐烧死自己的战友要强得多。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/qqxk21365e47cmwa36ya5co3g1whuo7.mp3","text":"我小时候很迷行军打仗，最想当的是大将军。但雷姆必拓没有这样的土壤，所以我只能进私人安保公司。现在？现在我只想让手下吃饱穿暖。至于将军梦，第一次看到身边有人中箭的时候就淡了。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/jy2f3ayiy323o8h52rlift4vp7u3aiw.mp3","text":"呼啊......好无聊啊，摆个榴弹塔吧——欸，你其实没睡？！不不不，这是空包弹，空包弹！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/j5kjzqxqj24roqxlfzaec4jybg3fsem.mp3","text":"感谢您选择与我司合作！我是火哨安保公司的负责人，我叫——欸？干员代号？嗯......直接叫我火哨好了！没错，这也是提升客户认知度的重要环节！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/bewotq2fmfjtya7qd5dkjpci1p09fi3.mp3","text":"这战术不错，要是在那个位置点把火就更完美了。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/mtg943h1kzvzypg11pd5ied55tim9gs.mp3","text":"晋升？多谢多谢，要是能多给我派几单安保任务我也会很开心的！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/a2tg8ma916n6wdp689hpsske1eyamxs.mp3","text":"和罗德岛达成合作之后，火哨公司终于扭亏为盈，我也不用再掏私房钱发工资了！博士，真的太感谢你了！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/9ye0sgufp4mxyyiwjwxvemf6ikpog22.mp3","text":"火哨，竭诚为你服务！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/pa4aoh4319l7geyk42djbk4c32rw11p.mp3","text":"队长？没问题，这个位置我再熟悉不过了。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/jgk4zgvnt20xyzodehx4whyad45cnzi.mp3","text":"出发，任务结束之后我请客！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/fr3o209a61wjhswjhufiztredfmru1e.mp3","text":"大家先做好隐蔽，等火点起来再动手。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/eg0pvbq8e6ogf3pp6ao5sxnrp3wt7m2.mp3","text":"怎么，需要点火焰助助兴？","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/8t5848agvfb37vgq4bopf5tga4djhdu.mp3","text":"请尽管下令。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/9vacrdo82qfw9n0x4q1h7rqmtamx48a.mp3","text":"准备就绪，随时可以点火。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/gtox61j93ikao6bngzhizy9bgug4oon.mp3","text":"炮手就位！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/oufrzjxxm0dvdboune3soy6o8vhj9e9.mp3","text":"烧吧！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/j3m7toxatv5kja82mp764wy1r41bw7y.mp3","text":"这一发是送给你的！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/8iwwx3jcdxuce7f7nbzdxp1aw5c2il9.mp3","text":"惊慌失措会被烧得更惨哦。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/0cfgyebwow81ys3vhggrgfe4c7l6la9.mp3","text":"装填，发射！","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/betwcy8hwkk0lgvhuuwo34dz7ui3o19.mp3","text":"这也可以？！唉......要是我司也有一个像你一样的战术天才就好了。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/9xr9o94of79cd5kkrpvpsjhz99lxaf0.mp3","text":"收工之前，先陪我去把火灭了吧。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/ouvap9wed34z7i5h3w04otk7ekea8oq.mp3","text":"要是放着不管，阴燃的柴草总有一天会变成火灾的源头，请务必注意。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/8ytyhfau7mn0aeidw5zp8f2ezdmztxy.mp3","text":"我来断后。别担心，这样的仗我打过不知多少次了。","alt":"voice/char_493_firwhl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwik